In-process dispatch timestamps: hrx_device_profile_dispatches_begin/flush/end hand completed dispatches (device
start/end ticks, command buffer, command index, grid) to a callback instead of a profile file. The engine's prefill
calibration times its GEMM candidates with them during real prefills.

